    <recordLookups>
        <description>아래 요건을 위하여, Allocation 미진행된 Child Claim 레코드 조회  
(확정된 Allocation 여부는 PLA인 경우에는 Status = Closed로 판단, SOC인 경우에는 Note 발행 여부 Closing Status = Posting Closed로 판단)

1. Market Type = Facility로 지정된 Panel
2. Allocation 미진행한 Child Claim 이 있으면 메세지 출력 &amp; Facility BDX를 발행불가</description>
        <name>Get_Claim</name>
        <label>Get Claim</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Loop_Claim_for_Placement_Id</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <faultConnector>
            <targetReference>Query_Limit</targetReference>
        </faultConnector>
        <filterLogic>1 AND ((2 AND 3 AND 4) OR (5 AND 6))</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>ParentClaim_lk__c</field>
            <operator>IsNull</operator>
            <value>
                <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <filters>
            <field>LastPLA_is__c</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <filters>
            <field>ClaimDocType__c</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue>PLA</stringValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <filters>
            <field>Status</field>
            <operator>NotEqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Closed</stringValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <filters>
            <field>ClaimDocType__c</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue>SOC</stringValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <filters>
            <field>ClosingStatus__c</field>
            <operator>NotEqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Posting Closed</stringValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>false</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>Claim</object>
        <sortField>CreatedDate</sortField>
        <sortOrder>Desc</sortOrder>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
